<element><id>UMLNote</id><coordinates><x>20</x><y>632</y><w>1215</w><h>110</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>Alternative flows
- No budget exists: 'a budget is required' message.
- No expenses recorded: 'no expenses recorded' message.
- Database cannot return the budget or expenses: user is told which could not be retrieved.
No AI is involved (deterministic).</panel_attributes><additional_attributes/></element>
